From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wined3d, d3d11: predication, clip status, ProcessVertices decl, UAV clear, format packing, flip effects (3629)

wined3d, d3d11: predication, clip status, ProcessVertices decl, UAV clear, format packing, flip effects

wined3d (+d3d11 query data, tests): ClipStatus and N-patch mode stored and read back, software VP flag without FIXME; ProcessVertices with an output vertex declaration (FVF derived); ID3D11 SetPredication really drops draw/dispatch/clear (CS waits for the predicate query, occlusion + SO overflow); predicate queries return a BOOL (GetDataSize 4); UAV clear of narrow typed buffers (packed via wined3d_format_pack); stretched CPU blit for 64/128-bit texels; colour fill for wide texels (fixed a write to map->data); format_convert_from_float for SNORM/SINT/UINT, R11G11B10_FLOAT, R9G9B9E5; SM4 umul/imul high word (16-bit limbs); flip swap effects and COPY_VSYNC; deferred Flush. Tests: d3d11 test_sg_wined3d (--sg), 318 todo_wine marks removed (SINT8 UAV clear), 2 d3d10core marks. Gates fastb-gapwd3d (d3d11 --sg) and fastb-gapwd3d9 (d3d9 probe). Mutants: SG_MUTANT_PREDICATE, UAVCLEAR, PREDSIZE (d3d11), CLIP, PVDECL. Conformance 64/32: d3d11 same 15 failures as stock, d3d9 52=52, d3d10core no new. umul/imul hi word is unverified on a GPU (formula checked by hand only). Careful mode (browsers/Office use wined3d/d3d11): integration should run the browser/Office checks. Mutants SG_MUTANT_PREDICATE, UAVCLEAR, PREDSIZE (gapwd3d), CLIP, PVDECL (gapwd3d9) each shown caught. d3d10core test: the keyed-mutex shared texture todo mark removed (now passes).
